1mrb|v|A wheel with a broad rim, or grooved rim, for transmitting power from, or imparting power to, the different parts of machinery, or for changing the direction of motion, by means of a belt, cord, rope, or chain.	o:lwu,92,5~lwu,92,5	s:zht,101,9~zht,101,9
